# Charger Port — photo selection manifest
# Format:  SOURCE   target.webp      (# comments + blank lines ignored)
# Convert with (any OS — needs `pip install pillow pillow-heif`):
#   python3 tools/convert_build_photos.py <staging-dir> docs/assets/build/charger-port/photos.manifest docs/assets/build/charger-port
